  "panel": {
    "_doc": "Wall panel 480x480 (mockup v1). y are text baselines. Top: clock left, day and date right. Middle: the temperature with a raised degree sign and the weather icon after it, centred together on center_x; wider than max_width (−12.3 with the icon) it is drawn at size_small. Under it one line: the boiler's fault (the thermostat's alert line), else the weather in words (+ by_forecast). A separator, then the slots: the hour floor(now) + first_h, then every every_h, each hour, icon, temperature and the chance of rain from pop_min %. No forecast: one line instead of the slots.",
